 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 1117,
   "end": 2492,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "This is interpres."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 2716,
   "end": 7582,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "It connects AssemblyAI's Voice",
    "Agent API to public MCP servers."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 7725,
   "end": 12252,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Type a website, press the mic,",
    "and its tools answer out loud."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 13648,
   "end": 20616,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "AssemblyAI lists its Voice Agent API at",
    "$4.50 an hour, and OpenAI Realtime at $18."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 21107,
   "end": 23995,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Realtime can call MCP servers by itself."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 23995,
   "end": 27155,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "The Voice Agent API has no MCP tool type,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 27155,
   "end": 30427,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "so teams that switch for the",
    "price lose their MCP tools."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 30427,
   "end": 32214,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "interpres gives them back."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 33981,
   "end": 36422,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Here's a real website with an MCP server."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 36422,
   "end": 40787,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "interpres looks in the official",
    "MCP registry, finds the server,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 40787,
   "end": 44265,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "and turns each of its tools into",
    "a Voice Agent function tool."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 46788,
   "end": 49116,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Agent: Connected to Goji",
    "with 9 tools available."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 49116,
   "end": 50406,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "What would you like to do?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 51283,
   "end": 53602,
   "who": "caller",
   "lines": [
    "Caller: What is SEO in plain English?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 58056,
   "end": 60736,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Agent: SEO stands for",
    "search engine optimization."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 60736,
   "end": 62837,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "It is the work of making",
    "your website the result"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 62837,
   "end": 64843,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "that search engines choose to show,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 64843,
   "end": 67891,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "by using content that answers",
    "what people are looking for and"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 67891,
   "end": 70442,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "making sure your site is",
    "easy for engines to read."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 70442,
   "end": 72790,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "You can learn more at goji.agency."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 74508,
   "end": 78392,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "That answer came from goji's own server,",
    "through a live tool call."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 81728,
   "end": 83535,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "No website in mind?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 83579,
   "end": 87766,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Search more than 11,000 public",
    "MCP servers right on the page."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 87766,
   "end": 89300,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "One click connects."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 93361.0625,
   "end": 95069.0625,
   "who": "caller",
   "lines": [
    "Caller: Who recommends Sapiens?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 99864.0625,
   "end": 102851.0625,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Agent: Sapiens is recommended",
    "by 32 verified people,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 102851.0625,
   "end": 105394.0625,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "including Joe Rogan and Lex Fridman."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 110165.0625,
   "end": 112677.0625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Many servers list more than ten tools."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 112832.0625,
   "end": 117175.0625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "interpres shows the agent ten at a time,",
    "and one of them is find tools."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 117314.0625,
   "end": 118695.0625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Ask for something out of view,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 118695.0625,
   "end": 122315.0625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "and interpres swaps the right",
    "tools in, mid-conversation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 129306.5625,
   "end": 131962.5625,
   "who": "caller",
   "lines": [
    "Caller: I want to run a spec",
    "check on a job contract."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 134525.5625,
   "end": 136291.5625,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Agent: I can certainly help you with that."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 136291.5625,
   "end": 139059.5625,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Please provide the job contract",
    "you'd like me to check."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 141131.5625,
   "end": 144782.5625,
   "who": "caller",
   "lines": [
    "Caller: What is the reputation",
    "of wallet 0x5A AEB6…"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 144782.5625,
   "end": 147563.5625,
   "who": "caller",
   "lines": [
    "…1BEA ED?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 153776.5625,
   "end": 155478.5625,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Agent: I may have misheard that value."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 155478.5625,
   "end": 158432.5625,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Please paste it into the",
    "box under the talk button,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 158432.5625,
   "end": 160718.5625,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "and I will use exactly what you paste."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 162550.5625,
   "end": 166758.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "A spoken address is held back,",
    "right or wrong. Nothing runs."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 167458.5625,
   "end": 169701.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Speech often gets identifiers wrong."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 170422.5625,
   "end": 174852.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Before this gate, a misheard wallet",
    "address reached the server 5 times,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 174852.5625,
   "end": 177675.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "and a right hearing looks",
    "exactly like a wrong one."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 177687.5625,
   "end": 182442.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "So the address comes from the paste box,",
    "and the agent uses the exact text."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 182919.5625,
   "end": 185623.5625,
   "who": "caller",
   "lines": [
    "Caller: Check the reputation",
    "of the wallet I pasted."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 190788.5625,
   "end": 193293.5625,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "Agent: That wallet currently",
    "has no recorded job outcomes,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 193293.5625,
   "end": 195402.5625,
   "who": "agent",
   "lines": [
    "so it doesn't have a reputation yet."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 196925.5625,
   "end": 198369.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "To check it isn't just these three,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 198369.5625,
   "end": 202308.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "we probed every remote server",
    "in the official MCP registry."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 202382.5625,
   "end": 204950.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "12,012 answered without a login,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 204950.5625,
   "end": 209129.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "listing more than 200,000 tools,",
    "and every tool converted."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 210569.5625,
   "end": 214420.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Then we gave thirty of them one",
    "spoken question each, untuned."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 214420.5625,
   "end": 218046.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Twenty-nine sessions ran,",
    "each one answered out loud,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 218046.5625,
   "end": 220411.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "and fourteen answered from live data."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 220598.5625,
   "end": 225011.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "When a tool ran, the median",
    "was 3.5 seconds voice to voice,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 225011.5625,
   "end": 227311.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "and the whole run cost 60 cents."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 228737.5625,
   "end": 233166.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Along the way we found two places where",
    "the API behaves differently from its docs,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 233166.5625,
   "end": 235940.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "and wrote both up with",
    "scripts that reproduce them."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 236964.5625,
   "end": 241976.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "interpres is open source under MIT,",
    "and live now at the address on screen."
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 242037.5625,
   "end": 244746.5625,
   "who": "narration",
   "lines": [
    "Type a website, press the mic, and ask."
   ]
  }
 ],
